{"tool_name":"pyxit-segmentation-model-prediction","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This is the \"prediction step\" of the Pyxit segmentation model builder. It is a learnable segmentation algorithm based on ground-truth images and segmentation mask. It learns a multiple output pixel classification algorithm. It downloads from Cytomine-Core annotation images+alphamasks from project(s), build a segmentation (pixel classifier) model which is saved locally. Typical application: tumor detection in tissues in histology slides.&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This is the \"prediction step\" of the Pyxit segmentation model builder. It is a learnable segmentation algorithm based on ground-truth images and segmentation mask. It learns a multiple output pixel classification algorithm. It downloads from Cytomine-Core annotation images+alphamasks from project(s), build a segmentation (pixel classifier) model which is saved locally. Typical application: tumor detection in tissues in histology slides.&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-18T16:49:11+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-13T12:24:11+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505227285,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Rapha\u00ebl Mar\u00e9e, Gilles Louppe, Loic Rollus, Olivier Caubo, Benjamin St\u00e9vens"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4986,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"e7cd7216-42bb-4d46-8a54-ae2fb6712e23","url":"/taxonomy/term/4986"},{"target_id":4583,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"ec977c08-a2fd-4abc-98ca-f1831465815f","url":"/taxonomy/term/4583"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":169,"tar